<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 120 bln yen in 0.6 pct two-yr notes.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 120 bln yen in 0.6 pct two-yr notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Thursday it was offering 120 billion yen in 0.6 percent two-year government notes through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at 0300 GMT and the results will be announced at 0530 GMT.</p>
<p>The issue date will be February 20 and the maturity date will be February 22, 1999.</p>
</text>
